{"id":67464,"date":"2026-04-11T08:40:36","date_gmt":"2026-04-11T07:40:36","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67464"},"modified":"2026-10-26T23:31:27","modified_gmt":"2026-10-26T22:31:27","slug":"ocr-sobral-challenge","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/ocr-sobral-challenge\/","title":{"rendered":"OCR Sobral Challenge 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">OCR Sobral Challenge 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>OCR Sobral Challenge 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>29 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com in\u00edcio e meta na Pra\u00e7a Dr. Eug\u00e9nio Dias, no centro hist\u00f3rico de <strong>Sobral de Monte Agra\u00e7o<\/strong> (distrito de Lisboa). Organizada pela <strong>FPOCR - Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Corridas de Obst\u00e1culos<\/strong> com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal e cronometragem oficial, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o pontua oficialmente para a Liga OCR Portugal.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O desafio principal desenrola-se ao longo de <strong>10 km com mais de 20 obst\u00e1culos<\/strong> exigentes (muros, suspens\u00f5es em barras e argolas, carregamento de pesos, valas de lama, passagens de \u00e1gua e rampas), testando a agilidade, for\u00e7a e supera\u00e7\u00e3o dos atletas. A prova divide-se nas vagas competitivas <strong>Liga Elite<\/strong> e <strong>Liga Competitive<\/strong> (desde 21,00 \u20ac), na vaga l\u00fadica <strong>Open<\/strong> (26,00 \u20ac) e na corrida <strong>Kids gratuita<\/strong>. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">29 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\