 padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Gratuito:<\/strong> 0,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (29\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o OCR Sobral Challenge 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento decorre no domingo, <strong>29 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, com secretariado, partidas e chegadas instalados na Pra\u00e7a Dr. Eug\u00e9nio Dias, no centro de Sobral de Monte Agra\u00e7o.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia do percurso e quantos obst\u00e1culos inclui?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O trajeto principal tem aproximadamente <strong>10 km de extens\u00e3o e integra mais de 20 obst\u00e1culos<\/strong> t\u00e9cnicos (estruturas de suspens\u00e3o, muros verticais e invertidos, valas de lama, po\u00e7os de \u00e1gua e transporte de cargas).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as diferen\u00e7as entre as vagas Elite, Competitive e Open?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As vagas <strong>Elite e Competitive<\/strong> regem-se pelas normas estritas da FPOCR e atribuem pontos para o ranking nacional, sendo obrigat\u00f3ria a supera\u00e7\u00e3o dos obst\u00e1culos com sistema de pulseiras. A vaga <strong>Open<\/strong> destina-se a atletas amadores e grupos com aux\u00edlio m\u00fatuo e penaliza\u00e7\u00f5es alternativas.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e fases de pagamento?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es iniciam-se nos 21,00 \u20ac para Elite e Competitive (26,00 \u20ac na 2\u00aa fase) e 26,00 \u20ac para a vaga Open (31,00 \u20ac na 2\u00aa fase). A prova Kids FPOCR \u00e9 gratuita. As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais s\u00e3o efetuadas online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma oficial do evento.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a taxa de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o dos atletas?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Inclui dorsal oficial, chip de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, seguro de acidentes pessoais, abastecimentos l\u00edquidos e s\u00f3lidos de percurso\/meta, medalha de finalista alusiva ao evento e acesso a banhos.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Crian\u00e7as e jovens podem participar no evento?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a vaga <strong>Kids FPOCR<\/strong> foi desenhada especialmente para crian\u00e7as com obst\u00e1culos seguros e l\u00fadicos, promovendo a inicia\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva \u00e0s corridas de obst\u00e1culos de forma 100% gratuita.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"OCR Sobral Challenge 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-29\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-29\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pra\u00e7a Dr. Eug\u00e9nio Dias, Sobral de Monte Agra\u00e7o\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Sobral de